{"name":"Duke","aka":"aka Prancer","description":"Duke, lovingly known as Prancer, was the brown greeter of the crew: alert, warm-hearted, loyal, and always ready for the next family moment. May he be surrounded by peace and light, free to run and rest, while his love remains close to the family he watched over. May every memory of Duke bring comfort, gratitude, and a gentle smile.","photos":["data:image/webp;base64,","data:image/webp;base64,"]}